      "waiter restaurant",
      "people eating restaurant"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Two chocolates? Even bigger tips.",
     "queries": [
      "chocolates",
      "candy bowl",
      "chocolate pieces"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "But the biggest came when the waiter walked away, turned back,",
     "queries": [
      "waiter walking",
      "waitress serving",
      "waiter"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "and offered one more, just for you.",
     "queries": [
      "hand offering chocolate",
      "giving gift",
      "chocolate box"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Free feels like a gift, and your brain wants to pay it back.",
     "queries": [
      "paying bill restaurant",
      "credit card payment",
      "cash tip table"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "That's why",
     "queries": [
      "chocolate",
      "restaurant table",
      "dessert"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "p05",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Taking a photo of something makes you remember it worse.",
     "queries": [
      "taking photo smartphone",
      "museum photo",
      "tourist photo"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "On a museum tour, people photographed some objects and just looked at others.",
     "queries": [
      "museum",
      "museum visitors",
      "art gallery"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "The next day, they remembered fewer of the photographed ones, and fewer details.",
     "queries": [
      "scrolling photos phone",
      "phone gallery",
      "woman thinking"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Your brain thinks: the camera's got it.",
     "queries": [
      "camera",
      "smartphone camera",
      "photographing"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "But zooming in on one detail fixed it.",
     "queries": [
      "zoom camera",
      "phone zoom",
      "close up statue"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Because remember:",
     "queries": [
      "museum statue",
      "sculpture",
      "gallery painting"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "p06",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Two in three men chose an electric shock over sitting alone with their thoughts.",
     "queries": [
      "man sitting alone",
      "electricity spark",
      "man thinking alone"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Fifteen minutes in an empty room.",
     "queries": [
      "empty room",
      "empty white room",
      "clock"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "No phone.",
     "queries": [
      "phone turned off",
      "phone face down",
      "no phone"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Just a button for a mild shock they'd said they'd pay to avoid.",
     "queries": [
      "pressing button",
      "finger button",
      "red button"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Two in three men pressed it. One in four women too.",
     "queries": [
      "man bored",
      "woman sitting alone",
      "bored woman"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Being alone with your mind is harder than it sounds. In fact,",
     "queries": [
      "man staring wall",
      "alone window",
      "person alone"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "p07",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "The moment you own something, it feels worth twice as much.",
     "queries": [
      "coffee mug",
      "mug hands",
      "holding mug"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "Half a class got a coffee mug. The other half could buy one.",
     "queries": [
      "classroom students",
      "lecture hall",
      "students"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "Owners wanted about seven dollars to sell.",
     "queries": [
      "dollar bills",
      "money",
      "cash"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "Buyers would pay under three.",
     "queries": [
      "coins",
      "paying coins",
      "coins hand"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Same mug.",
     "queries": [
      "mug table",
      "coffee cup table",
      "mug"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "Owning it made it feel like part of you.",
     "queries": [
      "woman holding cup",
      "man drinking coffee",
      "cozy coffee"
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "That's why selling your old stuff is so hard, and why",
     "queries": [
      "garage sale",
      "boxes moving",
      "old things"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "p08",
   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Chewing gum can push a stuck song out of your head.",
